{"about_the_game":"Down Further is an exploration-based, point-and-click horror game set in the deepest areas of the ocean. In a worldwide maritime war, the only &quot;safe&quot; places to travel are the trenches. Use whatever devices your vessel has to fend off whatever you encounter down there. <br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2></strong><br>Navigate the tunnels of the ocean while gathering data and moving supply shipments. Research shipwrecks, build up supplies, and upgrade your submarine to handle further parts of the ocean.<br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive</h2></strong><br>Wield a horn, sonar, and other rusty technology to keep the goliaths at bay. The further down into the ocean you get, the more dangerous the creatures become.<br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen</h2></strong><br>Understand the world above with the intel from below. See how maritime war has shaped the world of science and learn the <strong>deepest</strong> secrets.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123100?t=1770986787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123100?t=1770986787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770986787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770986787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Down Further is an exploration-based, point-and-click horror game set in the deepest areas of the ocean. In a worldwide maritime war, the only &quot;safe&quot; places to travel are the trenches. Use whatever devices your vessel has to fend off whatever you encounter down there. <br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2></strong><br>Navigate the tunnels of t